### Fazer login
# @name login
POST http://localhost:40000/Login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "username": "admin",
    "password": "admin"
}

### Listar todos os animais
GET http://localhost:40000/getAllAnimal
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Buscar animal por ID
GET http://localhost:40000/getAnimalByID/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

### Cadastrar animal
POST http://localhost:40000/insertAnimal
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "nome": "Boi Nelore",
    "datanascimento": "2022-05-10"
}

### Atualizar animal
PUT http://localhost:40000/updateAnimal/1
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}

{
    "nome": "Boi Nelore Atualizado",
    "datanascimento": "2022-06-15"
}

### Excluir animal
DELETE http://localhost:40000/deleteAnimal/1
Authorization: Bearer {{login.response.body.$.token}}